{"id":"656104419469b4d0","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-internal-consistency.md","title":"理论内一致性证明","display":"df-internal-consistency — 理论内一致性证明","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-internal-consistency","aliases":["91-df-internal-consistency"],"display":"df-internal-consistency — 理论内一致性证明","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-internal-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-internal-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-internal-consistency — 理论内一致性证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-internal-consistency-—-理论内一致性证明-$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}$\">df-internal-consistency — 理论内一致性证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> (承担证明的理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (被证明一致的可递归公理化理论)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(S)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的标准一致性句)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元元层可证一致性性质缩写，参数依次为承担证明的理论与目标理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{int}\">\\(\\mathrm{int}\\)</span> 为该证明层级的下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“内部”总是相对于承担证明的理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>，而且必须另标被证明\n一致的理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S=\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 与取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\mathcal T\">\\(S=\\mathcal T\\)</span> 是完全不同的主张。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 一致、可递归公理化、足够强并满足通常可证性条件，\nGödel 第二不完备定理排除\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。\n仅仅扩充语言或采用无类型真理谓词并不会绕过该结论。</p>\n<p>标准全归纳 KF 能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，即\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；\n这不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\\)</span>。\n相反，TB 与 UTB 的算术保守性使它们不能证明 PA 所不能证明的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。具体真理理论能证明哪个较弱理论的一致性，\n必须从其公理和归纳强度单独推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-internal-consistency-—-理论内一致性证明-$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}$","text":"df-internal-consistency — 理论内一致性证明 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{int}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,S)\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{int}}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1766,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb5e07d472a8bf03","anchor"